    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Siegebound</strong> \u2013 Defend, Build, and Survive the Onslaught!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>A Roguelike Tower Defense Strategy Game</strong> \u2694\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siegebound blends <strong>strategy, tower defense, and roguelike mechanics</strong> into a unique survival experience. Every siege is a test of tactical skill, adaptability, and strategic planning. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Blend of Strategy, Roguelike &amp; Tower Defense</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Base Building &amp; Expansion</strong> \u2013 Construct walls, towers, and defenses to fortify your castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Tactical Combat &amp; Unit Management</strong> \u2013 Deploy and upgrade Units and Buildings that synergize together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> \u2013 Level Up and spend ressources to buy powerful <strong>upgrades</strong> permanently enhancing your army or defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Gather ressources to expand your fortress and strengthen your army.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Withstand the Sieges?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>no two Castles are ever the same</strong>\u2014adapt your strategy, test new builds, and push your limits to defend against relentless Sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest coming soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist now and prepare for battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm Matzgo, a solo indie developer working under the name <strong>Peasant Games</strong>. <i>Siegebound</i> is a passion project inspired by my love for strategy games like <i>Age of Empires</i>, <i>Stronghold</i>, and roguelike games like <i>Hades</i>. My goal was to blend strategy game elements with roguelike systems, creating a game that rewards creative builds and adaptive playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback means everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s build, defend, and survive\u2014together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Siegebound</strong> \u2013 Defend, Build, and Survive the Onslaught!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>A Roguelike Tower Defense Strategy Game</strong> \u2694\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siegebound blends <strong>strategy, tower defense, and roguelike mechanics</strong> into a unique survival experience. Every siege is a test of tactical skill, adaptability, and strategic planning. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Blend of Strategy, Roguelike &amp; Tower Defense</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Base Building &amp; Expansion</strong> \u2013 Construct walls, towers, and defenses to fortify your castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Tactical Combat &amp; Unit Management</strong> \u2013 Deploy and upgrade Units and Buildings that synergize together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> \u2013 Level Up and spend ressources to buy powerful <strong>upgrades</strong> permanently enhancing your army or defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Gather ressources to expand your fortress and strengthen your army.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Withstand the Sieges?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>no two Castles are ever the same</strong>\u2014adapt your strategy, test new builds, and push your limits to defend against relentless Sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest coming soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist now and prepare for battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm Matzgo, a solo indie developer working under the name <strong>Peasant Games</strong>. <i>Siegebound</i> is a passion project inspired by my love for strategy games like <i>Age of Empires</i>, <i>Stronghold</i>, and roguelike games like <i>Hades</i>. My goal was to blend strategy game elements with roguelike systems, creating a game that rewards creative builds and adaptive playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback means everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s build, defend, and survive\u2014together.</p>",
